29:["$","p","1",{"children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"rgb(0, 0, 0)","fontSize":"20px"},"children":"The recent fuel price hike is mainly due to rising crude oil prices in the global market, with Brent crude crossing $111 per barrel because of ongoing tensions in West Asia and lower supply of discounted Russian oil. People across the country are worried that expensive fuel could soon make transport, food, and other daily essentials costlier."}]}]
